{"title":"INSANE","artist":"Black Gryph0n & Baasik","date":"2026-08-14","sourceId":"14693102:005","sourceHash":"c0f7d95744d2852302cbe1cae0d8ceee10910748e59ca57736ebbb0d6df523b1","duration":169.8,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":15.44,"end":16.6,"text":"Dearly beloved!","translation":"사랑하는 여러분","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":16.6,"end":17.82,"text":"For your entertainment","translation":"여러분의 즐거움을 위해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":17.82,"end":19.36,"text":"It's my pleasure to introduce to you","translation":"지옥에 새로 도착한 이를","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":19.36,"end":20.44,"text":"hell's latest arrival","translation":"소개하게 되어 기쁩니다","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":20.44,"end":23.64,"text":"The equal-opportunity killer, Alastor!","translation":"누구에게나 공평한 살인자 알래스터","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":23.98,"end":26.08,"text":"Hello, it's nice to meet you","translation":"안녕 만나서 반가워","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":26.08,"end":28.04,"text":"Oh, can you tell me where I am?","translation":"내가 어디 있는지 알려 줄래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":28.04,"end":30.08,"text":"I don't know how I got here","translation":"어떻게 여기 왔는지는 모르지만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":30.08,"end":32.38,"text":"But I, I think I'm starting to understand","translation":"이제 조금씩 알 것 같아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":32.38,"end":35.06,"text":"I don't belong among the angels","translation":"난 천사들 사이에 어울리지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":35.06,"end":36.88,"text":"And baby, that's just fine with me","translation":"그리고 그게 난 아주 좋아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":36.88,"end":39.6,"text":"The things I did up there were high school","translation":"위에서 했던 일은 고등학교 수준","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":39.6,"end":42.32,"text":"But now I'm going for my degree Hey","translation":"이제는 학위에 도전할 거야 이봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":42.32,"end":44.7,"text":"Sorry, but you just got in my way","translation":"미안하지만 네가 내 길을 막았어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":44.7,"end":46.86,"text":"I promise honey, I can feel your pain","translation":"약속할게 자기야 네 고통이 느껴져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":46.86,"end":49.74,"text":"And maybe I enjoy it just a little bit","translation":"그리고 어쩌면 난 그걸 조금 즐기는지도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":49.74,"end":51.72,"text":"Does that make me insane?","translation":"그럼 내가 미친 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":51.84,"end":53.96,"text":"Haven't been the same since I expired","translation":"죽은 뒤로 예전 같지는 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":53.96,"end":55.84,"text":"Doesn't mean that I plan to retire","translation":"그렇다고 은퇴할 생각은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":55.84,"end":58.0,"text":"And now I have the power to bathe","translation":"이제는 너희 모두를","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":58.0,"end":60.88,"text":"all of you in entertaining fire","translation":"즐거운 불길에 담글 힘이 있지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":78.65,"end":81.14,"text":"Wait a minute, do I know you?","translation":"잠깐만 내가 널 아나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":81.27,"end":82.75,"text":"Weren't you an old pal of mine?","translation":"예전 내 친구 아니었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":82.75,"end":85.15,"text":"Departed from us far too early","translation":"너무 일찍 우리 곁을 떠났지만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":85.15,"end":87.55,"text":"But now we're meeting a second time","translation":"이제 두 번째로 만나는군","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":87.55,"end":89.73,"text":"We used to have such fun together","translation":"우리 함께 정말 즐거웠지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":89.73,"end":91.89,"text":"And maybe you have what I need","translation":"어쩌면 넌 내게 필요한 걸 가졌을지도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":91.89,"end":94.31,"text":"But first I have one tiny question","translation":"하지만 먼저 작은 질문 하나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":94.31,"end":97.31,"text":"Tell me, do you demons bleed?","translation":"말해 봐 악마도 피를 흘리나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":98.49,"end":99.47,"text":"Hey","translation":"이봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":99.6,"end":101.82,"text":"Sorry, but you jus